{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:36:37+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-23T06:36:37+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Swisscom AG","sector":"Communication Services","industry":"Telecom Services","country":"Switzerland","city":"Worblaufen","website":"https://www.swisscom.ch","employees":22761,"summary":"Swisscom AG provides telecommunication services in Switzerland, Italy, and internationally. It operates through Switzerland, Italy, and Other segments. The company offers mobile communications, fixed network telephony, broadband, and TV to residential customers; telecommunications services and IT service solutions for corporate, public administration, and SME customers; business ICT infrastructure; range from individual products to end-to-end solutions to ICT infrastructure business; and makes network infrastructure to other telecommunications; and plans, operates, and maintains the network and IT infrastructure. It also provides network construction and maintenance, broadcasting services, and local search activities, as well as electronic signatures, digital certificates, and other trust services. In addition, the company offers integrated communication solutions, IT infrastructure, security, and cloud services to various workplace and other software solutions, IoT, and artificial intelligence; outsourcing services for financial and healthcare and public sectors; AI-supported services; and telecommunications provide a range of wholesale services for own use, refinement or resale based on copper, fibre-optic or mobile networks. Further, it provides broadband connections, leased lines, network connections, mobile virtual network operators, IP peering, co-location, and cable ducts; wholesale voice connections and roaming contracts; manages and markets digital booking platform; builds radio networks for broadcasting, security, and professional mobile radio networks; safety and security solutions; and ICT and network infrastructures for bandwidth, as well as road and tunnel construction. Additionally, the company provides FastwebAI Suite, a platform of generative artificial intelligence (AI) solutions designed for businesses and public authorities. Swisscom AG was incorporated in 1998 and is headquartered in Worblaufen, Switzerland.","exchange":"Swiss","currency":"CHF","financial_currency":"CHF","summary_fr":"Swisscom AG fournit des services de télécommunication en Suisse, en Italie et à l’international. Il opère à travers la Suisse, l'Italie et d'autres segments. La société offre des services de communications mobiles, de téléphonie fixe, de haut débit et de télévision aux clients résidentiels; des services de télécommunications et des solutions de services informatiques pour les entreprises, les administrations publiques et les PME; l'infrastructure des TIC pour les entreprises; allant des produits individuels aux solutions de bout en bout aux activités d'infrastructure des TIC; et fait de l'infrastructure de réseau à d'autres télécommunications; et planifie, exploite et entretient le réseau et l'infrastructure informatique."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":35432529920,"shares_outstanding":51801943,"trailing_pe":27.55842,"forward_pe":22.147856,"price_to_book":3.0762727,"ev_to_ebitda":11.968,"ev_to_revenue":3.486,"dividend_yield":0.038,"payout_ratio":1.0244,"beta_yahoo":0.402},"targets":{"current_price":684.0,"mean":573.7647,"median":582.0,"high":735.0,"low":440.0,"n_analysts":17,"reco_mean":3.88235,"reco_key":"underperform"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-11-05"],"eps_avg":7.35216,"eps_low":6.91598,"eps_high":7.78835,"revenue_avg":3668407750,"ex_dividend":"2026-03-27","dividend_date":"2025-04-01"},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.50979,"institutions_pct":0.24937999,"institutions_float_pct":0.50873,"institutions_n":398,"institutions":[{"name":"Pacer Advisors, Inc.","pct":0.0015,"shares":76740,"value":52490160,"date":"2026-